{"id": "97110017", "name": "מעלת פולינום מקלורן לדיוק נתון – sin(x₀), חסם שארית לגראנז'", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>רוצים לקרב את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\)</span> בעזרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_n\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_n\\)</span> הוא פולינום מקלורן מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=\\sin x\\)</span>.</p><p>לפי שארית לגראנז', <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(R_n(x)=\\frac{f^{(n+1)}(c)}{(n+1)!}x^{n+1}\\)</span>, ומכיוון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left|f^{(n+1)}(c)\\right|\\le 1\\)</span> מתקבל החסם</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left|R_n\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\right|\\le\\frac{\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{n+1}}{(n+1)!} \\]</p><p>מצאו את ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> <b>הקטן ביותר</b> שעבורו החסם הזה קטן מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(10^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span> (התשובה לפי החסם הזה בלבד).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(n=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בודקים עבור אילו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{n+1}}{(n+1)!}\\lt 10^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span>. החסם קטן כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> גדל, ולכן מספיק למצוא את ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> הראשון שבו הוא מתקיים (סעיף 8.7).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — החסם</b><br>לפי משפט 8.7.1 קיימת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span> בין <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span> ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(R_n\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)=\\frac{f^{(n+1)}(c)}{(n+1)!}\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{n+1}\\)</span>. כל נגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin x\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pm\\sin x\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\pm\\cos x\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left|f^{(n+1)}(c)\\right|\\le 1\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — בדיקת ערכי n</b><br>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:2}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{ {{CT:3}} }}{ {{CT:3}}!}={{CT:4}}\\approx {{CT:5}}\\ge 10^{ {{CT:1}} } \\]</p>ועבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:3}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{ {{CT:6}} }}{ {{CT:6}}!}={{CT:7}}\\approx {{CT:8}}\\lt 10^{ {{CT:1}} } \\]</p>לכן ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> הקטן ביותר הוא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ n={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta+1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>בחסם מופיעים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^{n+1}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((n+1)!\\)</span>, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^{n}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n!\\)</span>. בדקו גם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta-1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:2}}\\)</span> החסם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\approx {{CT:5}}\\)</span>, והוא אינו קטן מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(10^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["b1", "b2", "d1", "d2", "mm", "sign_of_x", "ta", "x0"], "nvariants": 30}